# Allowlist: the packaged extension is the bundled JavaScript and .NET helpers
# in dist/, media/, l10n/ and the manifest files. vsce re-includes anything a
# negated pattern matches, so list exactly what ships.
**
!package.json
!package.nls.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt
!testy.png
!media/**
!l10n/**
!dist/*.js
!dist/*/*.dll
!dist/*/*.deps.json
!dist/*/*.runtimeconfig.json
